      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_095/audio/song/p07.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 11441
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p08",
      "text": "Rosa's ancient drum had no plug. She hit it: BOOM! That got attention, and it got action.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_095/pages/p08.webp",
